{
  "id": "u01",
  "n": 1,
  "level": "A1",
  "title": "Pronouns, ser and estar",
  "summary": "Who is doing it, and the two verbs for \"to be\".",
  "explain": [
    {"h": "Subject pronouns"},
    {"table": [["yo", "I"], ["tú", "you (one person, informal)"], ["él / ella / usted", "he / she / you (formal)"], ["nosotros / nosotras", "we"], ["vosotros / vosotras", "you all (Spain, informal)"], ["ellos / ellas / ustedes", "they / you all (formal)"]]},
    {"p": "The verb ending already shows who is doing it, so Spanish usually **drops the pronoun**: *Soy ingeniero* = I am an engineer. Use the pronoun only for emphasis or contrast: *Yo trabajo, tú descansas.*"},
    {"p": "**Usted** (formal you) and **ustedes** (formal you all) take the same verb form as él and ellos."},
    {"h": "Two verbs for \"to be\""},
    {"table": [["", "ser", "estar"], ["yo", "soy", "estoy"], ["tú", "eres", "estás"], ["él / ella / usted", "es", "está"], ["nosotros", "somos", "estamos"], ["vosotros", "sois", "estáis"], ["ellos / ustedes", "son", "están"]], "head": true},
    {"p": "**Ser** says what something *is*: identity, job, origin, nationality, what it is like, time and dates."},
    {"ex": ["Soy Daniel. Soy de Bulgaria.", "I'm Daniel. I'm from Bulgaria."]},
    {"ex": ["Es una empresa pequeña.", "It's a small company."]},
    {"ex": ["Son las ocho.", "It's eight o'clock."]},
    {"p": "**Estar** says *where* something is and *how* it is right now: location, feelings, temporary states, results."},
    {"ex": ["Estoy en la obra.", "I'm at the site."]},
    {"ex": ["Estamos cansados.", "We're tired."]},
    {"ex": ["La ventana está rota.", "The window is broken."]},
    {"tip": "Quick test: *where* or *how right now* → estar. *What, who, from where, what kind* → ser. Some adjectives change meaning: *es listo* (he's clever), *está listo* (he's ready)."}
  ],
  "exercises": [
    {"type": "choice", "q": "Mi jefe ___ en Madrid hoy.", "options": ["es", "está"], "a": 1, "why": "Location → estar.", "tags": ["estar-place"]},
    {"type": "choice", "q": "Yo ___ de Bulgaria.", "options": ["soy", "estoy"], "a": 0, "why": "Origin → ser.", "tags": ["ser-origin"]},
    {"type": "choice", "q": "La reunión ___ muy importante.", "options": ["es", "está"], "a": 0, "why": "What it is like (a characteristic) → ser.", "tags": ["ser-trait"]},
    {"type": "choice", "q": "Hoy ___ muy cansado.", "options": ["soy", "estoy"], "a": 1, "why": "How you are right now → estar.", "tags": ["estar-state"]},
    {"type": "choice", "q": "El cristal ___ roto.", "options": ["es", "está"], "a": 1, "why": "A result / current state → estar.", "tags": ["estar-state"]},
    {"type": "choice", "q": "Ana ___ arquitecta.", "options": ["es", "está"], "a": 0, "why": "Profession → ser.", "tags": ["ser-job"]},
    {"type": "choice", "q": "¿Dónde ___ las llaves?", "options": ["son", "están"], "a": 1, "why": "Where → estar.", "tags": ["estar-place"]},
    {"type": "choice", "q": "___ las tres y media.", "options": ["Son", "Están"], "a": 0, "why": "Time → ser.", "tags": ["ser-time"]},
    {"type": "choice", "q": "Nosotros ___ en la oficina.", "options": ["somos", "estamos"], "a": 1, "why": "Location → estar.", "tags": ["estar-place"]},
    {"type": "choice", "q": "Las ventanas de PVC ___ muy buenas.", "options": ["son", "están"], "a": 0, "why": "A general quality → ser.", "tags": ["ser-trait"]},
    {"type": "gap", "q": "Yo ___ ingeniero.", "hint": "ser", "a": "soy", "en": "I am an engineer.", "tags": ["ser-forms", "ser-job"]},
    {"type": "gap", "q": "¿Tú ___ de España?", "hint": "ser", "a": "eres", "en": "Are you from Spain?", "tags": ["ser-forms"]},
    {"type": "gap", "q": "Nosotros ___ compañeros de trabajo.", "hint": "ser", "a": "somos", "en": "We are colleagues.", "tags": ["ser-forms"]},
    {"type": "gap", "q": "Vosotros ___ muy amables.", "hint": "ser", "a": "sois", "en": "You (all) are very kind.", "tags": ["ser-forms"]},
    {"type": "gap", "q": "¿Cómo ___ (tú)?", "hint": "estar", "a": "estás", "en": "How are you?", "tags": ["estar-forms"]},
    {"type": "gap", "q": "Ellos ___ en la furgoneta.", "hint": "estar", "a": "están", "en": "They are in the van.", "tags": ["estar-forms", "estar-place"]},
    {"type": "gap", "q": "Yo ___ en casa.", "hint": "estar", "a": "estoy", "en": "I'm at home.", "tags": ["estar-forms"]},
    {"type": "gap", "q": "¿Vosotros ___ listos?", "hint": "estar", "a": "estáis", "en": "Are you (all) ready?", "tags": ["estar-forms"]},
    {"type": "gap", "q": "Usted ___ el nuevo cliente, ¿verdad?", "hint": "ser", "a": "es", "en": "You are the new client, right?", "tags": ["ser-forms", "usted"]},
    {"type": "match", "instr": "Match the pronoun to its meaning.", "pairs": [["yo", "I"], ["nosotros", "we"], ["vosotros", "you all (informal)"], ["usted", "you (formal)"], ["ellas", "they (women)"]], "tags": ["pronouns"]},
    {"type": "error", "q": "Soy en la oficina.", "a": "Estoy en la oficina.", "why": "Location needs estar.", "tags": ["estar-place"]},
    {"type": "error", "q": "Mi hermana está médica.", "a": "Mi hermana es médica.", "why": "Profession needs ser.", "tags": ["ser-job"]},
    {"type": "translate", "q": "I'm tired.", "a": "Estoy cansado / Estoy cansada", "tags": ["estar-state"]},
    {"type": "translate", "q": "We are from Bulgaria.", "a": "Somos de Bulgaria", "tags": ["ser-origin"]},
    {"type": "translate", "q": "Where is the bank?", "a": "¿Dónde está el banco?", "tags": ["estar-place"]},
    {"type": "reorder", "words": ["La", "ventana", "está", "abierta"], "a": "La ventana está abierta", "en": "The window is open.", "tags": ["estar-state"]},
    {"type": "reorder", "words": ["Mi", "novia", "es", "muy", "simpática"], "a": "Mi novia es muy simpática", "en": "My girlfriend is very nice.", "tags": ["ser-trait"]}
  ]
}
